        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\n\nactor \&quot;Administrator\&quot; as Admin\n\nrectangle \&quot;Sistem Data Master &amp; Transaksi PT Kyan Mitra Properti\&quot; {\n  usecase \&quot;Login\&quot; as UC_Login\n  usecase \&quot;Melihat Dashboard\&quot; as UC_Dash\n  \n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Master\&quot; as UC_Master\n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Perumahan\&quot; as UC_Perum\n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Tipe Rumah\&quot; as UC_Tipe\n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Unit Rumah\&quot; as UC_Unit\n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Pelanggan\&quot; as UC_Pelanggan\n  usecase \&quot;Mengelola Data Sales\&quot; as UC_Sales\n  usecase \&quot;Mencetak Data Master\&quot; as UC_CetakMaster\n\n  usecase \&quot;Mencatat Booking Fee\&quot; as UC_Booking\n  usecase \&quot;Mencetak Kwitansi Booking\&quot; as UC_KwitansiBK\n\n  usecase \&quot;Mencatat Penjualan\&quot; as UC_Penjualan\n  usecase \&quot;Mencetak Nota Penjualan\&quot; as UC_Nota\n\n  usecase \&quot;Mencatat Angsuran Pembayaran\&quot; as UC_Angsuran\n  usecase \&quot;Mencetak Kwitansi Angsuran\&quot; as UC_KwitansiAG\n\n  usecase \&quot;Mencetak Laporan Penjualan\&quot; as UC_Laporan\n  usecase \&quot;Logout\&quot; as UC_Logout\n}\n\n&#39; Asosiasi Aktor dengan Use Case\nAdmin -- UC_Dash\nAdmin -- UC_Master\nAdmin -- UC_Booking\nAdmin -- UC_Penjualan\nAdmin -- UC_Angsuran\nAdmin -- UC_Laporan\nAdmin -- UC_Logout\n\n&#39; Generalisasi Data Master (Anak mengarah ke Induk/Umum)\nUC_Perum --|&gt; UC_Master\nUC_Tipe --|&gt; UC_Master\nUC_Unit --|&gt; UC_Master\nUC_Pelanggan --|&gt; UC_Master\nUC_Sales --|&gt; UC_Master\n\n&#39; Relasi &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt; (Mengarah ke Use Case syarat yang dibutuhkan)\nUC_Dash ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Master ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Booking ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Penjualan ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Angsuran ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\nUC_Laporan ..&gt; UC_Login : &lt;&lt;include&gt;&gt;\n\n&#39; Relasi &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt; (Mengarah ke Use Case inti)\nUC_CetakMaster ..&gt; UC_Master : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC_KwitansiBK ..&gt; UC_Booking : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC_Nota ..&gt; UC_Penjualan : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\nUC_KwitansiAG ..&gt; UC_Angsuran : &lt;&lt;extend&gt;&gt;\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="QYNJmnYdOrVeOOKu7dCL-1">
